NebulaScreen - the touchscreen app of NebulaOS for the Creality Ender-3 V3 KE.

NebulaScreen is based on GuppyScreen by ballaswag
(https://github.com/ballaswag/guppyscreen), through the OpenKE fork, and is
distributed under the GNU General Public License v3 (see LICENSE). Internal
source identifiers (for example the GuppyScreen class and GUPPY_* build
flags) keep their upstream names. Third-party components keep their own
licences (LVGL, libhv, spdlog, lv_drivers, lv_touch_calibration).
